  "aboutParagraphs": [
    "Fehringer Ranch is a huge open-space course at the base of the foothills in Littleton — 18 holes on a 135-acre property with terrific mountain views and, according to the locals, the best practice area in the city. From the current pin positions it plays about 5,500–6,000 feet at par 54.",
    "Free to play with concrete tees and Mach 3 baskets, it's an approachable park course with real scenic payoff — the open fairways give you room to learn, and the foothill backdrop makes every round feel like a day out.",
    "Come for the practice area, stay for the views, and bring a putter you trust."
  ],
