  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 18 closes Fehringer Ranch at 388 feet with the foothills on the horizon — the hole that makes this open-space course feel special. An open fairway, a clean approach, and a mountain backdrop that reminds you why Denver players love this park. It's the friendliest kind of signature: memorable, scenic, and fair.",
